  "68093b41-a4b6-4d03-a9f0-caaf27fb0f58"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the options a causal substrate is drawn with at a given size"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"3c23bfc1-65f8-4bb4-bcb3-64cac219bde5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
