 "the held code that builds a named causal substrate"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"013389a6-323a-4554-b686-79f03750ee49"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Random causal graphs", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"0b431c3e-7676-499e-9b04-e4ce96efed44"],

Cell[TextData[{
