  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7e906dd8-521c-4de8-a52f-6418c04c142a"],
 " events: the Hasse diagram of a transitive percolation with link \
probability ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["p", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "422f0db8-a9e5-4f0b-92ea-8064d627e5a7"],
 ", of a random acyclic orientation with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7982a06b-c25c-4655-9ab4-025823345e71"],
 " edges, or of a sprinkling into ",
